        "cheat_sheet": {
            "type": "TextDAT",
            "position": [200, 600],
            "parameters": {
                "text": {
                    "value": "log() Function Reference\n========================\n\nScript operators (ScriptCHOP, ScriptDAT, etc.):\n  log(msg)        -> INFO level\n  log_debug(msg)  -> DEBUG level\n  log_warn(msg)   -> WARN level\n  log_error(msg)  -> ERROR level\n\nExpression parameters:\n  log(msg)        -> INFO level (returns 0)\n\nAll messages appear in the Textport log panel.\nThe node ID is used as the log category.\nNo-op in exported player builds."
                }
            }
        },
