            "text": "log() Bridge — Script & Expression Demo\n\nOpen the Textport (Log button in toolbar) to see\nlive log output from both the ScriptCHOP and the\nexpression parameter on constant1.\n\nscript1: uses log(), log_warn(), log_debug()\nconstant1: expression calls log() (returns 0, side-effect)\ncheat_sheet: TextDAT with function reference",
